iosos"],"explanation":"Sus rocas conservan una extraordinaria muestra de vida marina del Triásico.","sources":[{"id":"ti-fossils-17","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1090","title":"UNESCO · Monte San Giorgio","authority":"UNESCO World Heritage Centre","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Description; integrity"}],"source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1090","source_title":"UNESCO · Monte San Giorgio","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"TI:monte-fosiles","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["be073f9fe58bec1d72be9a0bac6bf23c"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ti-rio-prehistorico","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TI","scope":"canton","canton":"TI","topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Encuentras peces y reptiles marinos fósiles estudiados en Monte San Giorgio. ¿Qué te cuentan del paisaje de hace millones de años?","options":["Que allí hubo una cuenca marina poco profunda","Que era una gran llanura de agua dulce","Que era un desierto de dunas","Que estaba cubierto por un glaciar permanente"],"explanation":"La investigación paleontológica reconstruye un antiguo medio marino del Triásico, muy distinto al paisaje actual.","sources":[{"id":"ti-fossil-museum-17","url":"https://www.nmz.uzh.ch/en/permanentexhibition/monte_san_giorgio.html","title":"UZH · Monte San Giorgio","authority":"Universität Zürich, Naturhistorisches Museum","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Marine reptiles; fish"}],"source_url":"https://www.nmz.uzh.ch/en/permanentexhibition/monte_san_giorgio.html","source_title":"UZH · Monte San Giorgio","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":fa