al · Ordenanza de Fasnacht","authority":"Stadt Liestal","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"§3; §25.6–7; §26.2"}],"source_url":"https://www.liestal.ch/_docn/5214862/700.13_Fasnachtsverordnung.pdf","source_title":"Liestal · Ordenanza de Fasnacht","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BL:chienbase-cristal","status":"published","municipality":"Liestal","jurisdiction_note":"Ordenanza de la ciudad de Liestal durante su Fasnacht, no norma general de todos los municipios.","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0},"known":["d42e1936b808791659ccb78ab3483c8a"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-bl-bosque-mayo","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BL","scope":"canton","canton":"BL","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En mayo paseas con un perro tranquilo por un bosque de Basel-Landschaft. ¿Qué exige la regla estacional publicada?","options":["Llevarlo con correa, también en las proximidades del bosque","Soltarlo si obedece habitualmente","Usar correa solo si hay animales visibles","Aplicar la regla solo si el perro es grande"],"explanation":"La regla del 1 de abril al 31 de julio protege a la fauna durante la reproducción y crianza.","sources":[{"id":"bl-wildlife-17","url":"https://www.baselland.ch/politik-und-behorden/direktionen/volkswirtschafts-und-gesundheitsdirektion/medienmitteilungen/ab-1-april-wieder-leinenpflicht-zum-schutz-der-wildtiere","title":"Basel-Landschaft · Correa y fauna","authority":"Kanton Basel-Landschaft","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Aviso30.03.2026; Leine; Wildkatzen"}],"source_url":"https://www.baselland.ch/politik-und-behorden/direktionen/volkswirtschafts-und-gesundheitsdirektion/medienmitteilungen/ab-1-april-wieder-leinenpflicht-zum-schutz-der-wildtiere","source_title":"Basel-Landschaft · Correa y fauna","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","