os, prados, viñas y huertos","Transportar madera por flotación como uso principal","Llevar agua potable exclusivamente a estaciones de tren","Defender militarmente las fronteras"],"explanation":"Son canales históricos de riego; muchos siguen utilizándose y necesitan mantenimiento.","sources":[{"id":"vs-bisses-17","url":"https://www.valais.ch/en/explore/activities/hiking/bisses","title":"Valais · Canales de riego históricos","authority":"Valais/Wallis Promotion","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Descripción y preguntas de temporada"}],"source_url":"https://www.valais.ch/en/explore/activities/hiking/bisses","source_title":"Valais · Canales de riego históricos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"VS:bisse-riego","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["627ecddf786f650600ab6c664aaca5a4"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-vs-luizet-fruta","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"VS","scope":"canton","canton":"VS","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"¿Qué fruta es la variedad Luizet del Valais?","options":["Albaricoque","Manzana","Cereza","Pera"],"explanation":"Es una variedad tradicional. Los productores también cultivan otras que maduran en diferentes momentos.","sources":[{"id":"vs-apricot-17","url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/savourer/inspirations/recits/au-royaume-du-prince-valaisan","title":"Valais · Huertos de albaricoques","authority":"Valais/Wallis Promotion","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Variedades y cosecha"}],"source_url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/savourer/inspirations/recits/au-royaume-du-prince-valaisan","source_title":"Valais · Huertos de albaricoques","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_sta