d","Una presa de bóveda","Una presa de tierra","Una presa móvil de compuertas"],"explanation":"Su enorme masa forma parte de su diseño. Está en el val de Dix.","sources":[{"id":"vs-dixence-17","url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/explorer/activites/autres-activites-estivales/visites-de-barrages/grande-dixence","title":"Valais · Grande Dixence","authority":"Valais/Wallis Promotion","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Descripción del muro"}],"source_url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/explorer/activites/autres-activites-estivales/visites-de-barrages/grande-dixence","source_title":"Valais · Grande Dixence","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"VS:barrage-poids","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["d55d87fe8c382ebcd7261f9b6cd4bbde"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-vs-sion-colinas","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"VS","scope":"canton","canton":"VS","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"¿Qué dos nombres corresponden a las colinas monumentales que dominan Sion?","options":["Valère","Tourbillon","Uetliberg","Gurten"],"explanation":"Sus edificios históricos forman una de las imágenes más conocidas de la ciudad.","sources":[{"id":"vs-sion-17","url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/explorer/activites/culture-patrimoine/chateaux-batisses/chateaux-de-valere-et-tourbillon","title":"Valais · Valère y Tourbillon","authority":"Valais/Wallis Promotion","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Dos colinas de la ciudad; órgano"}],"source_url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/explorer/activites/culture-patrimoine/chateaux-batisses/chateaux-de-valere-et-tourbillon","source_title":"Valais · Valère y Tourbillon","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_