ais ya no tienen ningún uso agrícola.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"Muchos siguen transportando agua de riego y se mantienen cuidadosamente.","sources":[{"id":"vs-bisses-17","url":"https://www.valais.ch/en/explore/activities/hiking/bisses","title":"Valais · Canales de riego históricos","authority":"Valais/Wallis Promotion","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Descripción y preguntas de temporada"}],"source_url":"https://www.valais.ch/en/explore/activities/hiking/bisses","source_title":"Valais · Canales de riego históricos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"VS:bisses-activos-vs","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["5b98167365257b75518d37f9fe31ca0e"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-vs-raclette-leyenda-vs","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"VS","scope":"canton","canton":"VS","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"El relato de Léon descubriendo la raclette junto al fuego es una leyenda, no un hecho demostrado.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"La fuente la presenta expresamente como leyenda. La documentación histórica del queso fundido es otra cuestión.","sources":[{"id":"vs-raclette-17","url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/savourer/specialites-du-valais/raclette","title":"Valais · Raclette","authority":"Valais/Wallis Promotion","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Historia y producto"}],"source_url":"https://www.valais.ch/fr/savourer/specialites-du-valais/raclette","source_title":"Valais · Raclette","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"VS:raclette-leyenda-vs","status":"